	(text "U1172 P0 / P1 / P3: DATA / CLOCK / LATCH.\nU1172 P2: host orientation. P4: HUB_RUN.\nU1172 P5 / P6: input-protection fault / charging PG.\nGPIO37 reads HOST_BUDGET_FAULT_N.\nBits 0–4 select 9 V, bits 5–9 discharge targets.\nBit 10 enables the charging input; bits 11–12 select host budget; bit 13 enables host targets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d41a3fb2-4930-48b0-b308-6477ffc143b0")
	)
	(text "MCU GPIO35 keeps /OE high through reset. Clear all 16 bits before enabling outputs. Every controlled load has a pulldown."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dbe27e6f-919f-421a-8e8e-4293440247a4")
	)
	(text "Power control registers — fitted in both populations"
